{"id":"A1-L067","title":"Key verb: keep","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U04","focus":"Verbo-chave: keep","targets":{"grammar":"Verbo-chave: keep","pron":"think/this","verbs":["thank"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["poem","change","newspaper","motto","magazine","history","science","math"],"field":"Moradia","genre":"Biografia","skill":"Fala","words_min":8},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 67 · Key verb: keep","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verbo-chave: keep.","**Verbos:** thank.","**Pronúncia:** think/this.","**8 palavras novas** (moradia).","**Texto do dia:** biografia."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo usar keep e agradecer com thank em uma biografia."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["poem","poema"],["change","troco"],["newspaper","jornal"],["motto","lema"],["magazine","revista"],["history","história (matéria)"],["science","ciência"],["math","matemática"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short biography","blocks":[{"type":"bio","name":"Grandma Rosa","paras":["Rosa **keeps** a small garden. She **keeps** her keys in a blue bowl and **keeps** quiet when people sleep.","Every Sunday she **thanks** her neighbors for the vegetables. “**Keep** the change,” she says to the baker.","Her tip: **keep going** and **keep smiling**."],"years":"Born 1948","facts":[["Home","a small house"],["Hobby","gardening"],["Motto","keep smiling"],["Sunday","thanks neighbors"]],"gloss":[["garden","jardim"],["change","troco"],["bowl","tigela"],["motto","lema"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Rosa keeps a garden.","ans":"T","why":"“keeps a small garden.”"},{"q":"She keeps her keys in a box.","ans":"F","why":"blue bowl."},{"q":"She thanks her neighbors on Sunday.","ans":"T","why":"“Every Sunday.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“keep the change” means…","opts":["fique com o troco","devolva o troco","conte o troco"],"ans":0,"why":"keep the change."},{"q":"“garden” means…","opts":["jardim","garagem","cozinha"],"ans":0,"why":"garden."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Key verb: keep","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["guardar","**keep the keys in a bowl**"],["manter-se","**keep quiet / keep warm**"],["continuar","**keep going / keep smiling**"],["ficar com","**keep the change**"]],"cap":"Key verb: keep"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**keep + adjetivo** = manter-se; **keep + -ing** = continuar."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She ___ her keys in a bowl. (keep)","a":"keeps","why":"she → keeps."},{"s":"___ quiet, please. (Keep)","a":"Keep","why":"imperativo."},{"s":"Keep ___ ! (go)","a":"going","why":"keep + -ing."},{"s":"I ___ my neighbors. (thank)","a":"thank","why":"thank."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["poem","poema"],["change","troco"],["newspaper","jornal"],["motto","lema"],["magazine","revista"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["the","change","Here","is","$10","Keep"],"ans":"Here is $10 Keep the change","pt":"Aqui estão 10. Fique com o troco."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"poem","pos":"word","pt":"poema","ex":"A short poem.","expt":"Um poema curto."},{"w":"change","pos":"word","pt":"troco","ex":"Keep the change.","expt":"Fique com o troco."},{"w":"newspaper","pos":"word","pt":"jornal","ex":"Read the newspaper.","expt":"Leia o jornal."},{"w":"motto","pos":"word","pt":"lema","ex":"Her motto.","expt":"Seu lema."},{"w":"magazine","pos":"word","pt":"revista","ex":"A fashion magazine.","expt":"Uma revista de moda."},{"w":"history","pos":"word","pt":"história (matéria)","ex":"History is fun.","expt":"História é divertida."},{"w":"science","pos":"word","pt":"ciência","ex":"Science class.","expt":"Aula de ciências."},{"w":"math","pos":"word","pt":"matemática","ex":"Math is hard.","expt":"Matemática é difícil."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Here is $10. Keep the change.** — Aqui estão 10. Fique com o troco.","**Thank you!** — Obrigado!","**Keep smiling!** — Continue sorrindo!"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"keep","pt":"guardar, manter","forms":[["I / you / we / they keep","I keep my keys here."],["he / she / it keeps","She keeps a garden."]]},{"v":"thank","pt":"agradecer","forms":[["I / you / we / they thank","I thank my neighbors."],["he / she / it thanks","He thanks the baker."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At the bakery","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At the bakery","lines":[["Rosa","Here is $10. Keep the change.","Aqui estão 10. Fique com o troco."],["Baker","Thank you!","Obrigado!"],["Rosa","Keep smiling!","Continue sorrindo!"],["Baker","You too!","Você também!"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: think/this","items":[{"label":"think/this","note":"/θ/ sem voz (think) × /ð/ com voz (this): língua entre os dentes.","words":["think","this","three","that","thank","they"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you keep at home.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I keep my keys in a bowl."},{"q":"Encourage a friend.","pt":"Incentive.","model":"Keep going!"},{"q":"Thank someone.","pt":"Agradeça.","model":"Thank you so much."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with keep.","model":"I keep my keys in a bowl. Keep quiet, please. She keeps a garden. Keep the change. Keep going!","checklist":["Usei **keep 3 vezes**","Usei **keep + adjetivo**","Usei **keep + -ing**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “poem” mean?","opts":["poema","troco","lema"],"ans":0,"why":"**poem** = poema."},{"q":"What does “change” mean?","opts":["jornal","troco","revista"],"ans":1,"why":"**change** = troco."},{"q":"What does “newspaper” mean?","opts":["lema","história (matéria)","jornal"],"ans":2,"why":"**newspaper** = jornal."},{"q":"What does “motto” mean?","opts":["lema","revista","ciência"],"ans":0,"why":"**motto** = lema."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}